# Git settings that prevent the most common team conflicts. See AGENTS.md, "Avoiding conflicts".

# Store and check out text with LF line endings on every computer (Windows, macOS, Linux),
# so nobody's editor turns every line into a "change".
* text=auto eol=lf

# Append-only logs: everybody adds a row at the bottom. `merge=union` keeps BOTH sides' new rows
# instead of stopping with a conflict. (Only for files where rows are only ever added.)
AI-USAGE.md merge=union
docs/DECISIONS.md merge=union
